<%- include('../partials/layout-start') %>
<%- include('../partials/page-header', { icon: 'bi-file-text', heading: 'Terms of service' }) %>
<section class="glass-section pb-5">
<div class="container">
  <div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-8">
    <div class="glass-card"><div class="card-body">
      <p class="text-muted-2">Version <%= version %></p>

      <h2 class="h6">The service</h2>
      <p>SAP Hub connects consultants and companies in the SAP ecosystem. We are a
         marketplace: we are not party to any engagement agreed through it, and we do not employ,
         vet or guarantee anyone listed here.</p>

      <h2 class="h6">Your account</h2>
      <p>One account per person. Keep your password to yourself. You are responsible for what is
         posted from your account.</p>

      <h2 class="h6">What you post</h2>
      <p>Job posts and profiles must be truthful and must describe a real role or a real person.
         Discriminatory postings, fake listings and scraped content are removed and the account is
         closed.</p>

      <h2 class="h6">Rate contributions</h2>
      <p>Contribute your own figures only. The index is a community estimate, not advice and not a
         guarantee of what anyone will pay.</p>

      <h2 class="h6">Trademarks</h2>
      <p>SAP, S/4HANA, SuccessFactors, Ariba, Concur, Fieldglass and related names are
         trademarks of SAP SE. This service is independent and not affiliated with,
         endorsed by, or sponsored by SAP SE.</p>

      <h2 class="h6">Liability</h2>
      <p>The service is provided as-is. We are not liable for engagements, hiring decisions or losses
         arising from information found here.</p>
    </div></div>
  </div></div>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/layout-end') %>
